  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implementation of Codex standards to support containment and reduction of foodborne AMR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will aim to work at both the global and local levels to support the implementation of Codex standards, especially those related to the containment and reduction of foodborne AMR, and then to monitor the use and impact of Codex standards.</narrative>
